Whisper small: the speech recognition model behind «Transcribir letra»
(crates/stems/src/whisper.rs, crates/app/src/lyrics_ui.rs), by OpenAI, under
the MIT License. It is not in this repository nor built into the app: Pulse
downloads it the first time it is used, after asking, from
https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/whisper-small (revision
36050c46d777d46dc4b5f43f6d90574fc38f8732): onnx/encoder_model_quantized.onnx,
onnx/decoder_model_merged_quantized.onnx and tokenizer.json, the ONNX export of
https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-small by Hugging Face's Optimum, run
unchanged. Pulse's log-mel spectrogram and decoding follow
https://github.com/openai/whisper (MIT).

